# Ash Enterprise: 21 - Processes

Runtime: **attached node**. Designer at `/bpmn` in the running app.

Effort: **heavy** — the longest lesson: four files, one diagram, one process. *You'll feel the whole journey become one drawable picture.*

## The graph orchestrates

